#BNF+IAT 1.0 UTF-8;
!grammar call;

!slot <action>;

!start <callstart>;

<callstart>:(小车|开始|打开|关闭)<choose>;

<choose>:<action>|<navigation>|<turn>|<follow>|<pick>;

<action>:前进|后退|停止|停|过来|休眠|自主建图|导航;

<navigation>:去(I|J|K|O|P|Q)点;

<turn>:(左|右)转;

<follow>:(雷达|色块|视觉)跟随;

<pick>:夹取色块|抓取色块;
